WEBVTT

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.770
Welcome to the Sunlit Mansion, Mademoiselle.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:52.080
Phase 02: Under the Table

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:01.470
Henceforth, this shall be your home.

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.250
It's marvelous!

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:09.540
You seem pleased.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:14.080
However, in that captivating dress, you are far lovelier.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.380
My...

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.730
Please don't tease me.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.000
Come. Allow me to show you to your room.

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.230
My room?

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.300
It's on the second floor.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.530
There's nothing else for me, is there?

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.090
I've got research to do.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.580
Yes, thank you.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.660
Research?

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:45.080
Despite his age, he is quite a talented scientist.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.020
Come in.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.640
From now on, this will be your room.

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:03.390
It's so charming!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.620
This room has been prepared for me?

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:10.000
Yes. I knew you'd come.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:15.090
Please rest for a while.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:18.490
I'll call you when dinner has been prepared.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.230
Nyx?

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.020
Yes?

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:24.330
Um... I look forward to working with you!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.100
As do I.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:57.890
You understand now, don't you?

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:00.620
You have powers.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.550
I still can't believe it.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.040
Why would I have such powers...?

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.210
It's not a question of whether you believe it or not.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.020
That's the reality of it.

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:14.800
Lein, it's understandable.

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:18.260
She's had quite a day.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.410
The Thanatos attacks just keep increasing.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.510
We don't have time for this!

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:27.990
Unfortunately, he's right.

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:36.360
As we speak, it's possible that somewhere in Arcadia, helpless people are being attacked by the Thanatos.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.500
In order to save the suffering people from the Thanatos,

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:45.080
please, lend us your power so that we can save them.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:55.100
I might be able to save more people this way than I would by becoming a doctor.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.680
I understand.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.690
If I can be of use...

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.170
Take care, okay?

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.670
You too, Hannah...

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.090
I'll be so lonely, Angie!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:13.290
Sally, let's send her off with a smile, okay?

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.650
I can't!

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:18.040
Sally...

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.620
Hannah...

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.000
You're the cat from before...

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.250
You followed me?

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:51.930
Will you be my friend?

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:56.390
That's a dainty cat.

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:59.840
If you wish, you may keep it.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.540
Thank you!

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.250
Isn't that great, Erwin?

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.320
Erwin?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:07.310
He has to have a name.

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:11.510
I'm glad you've got such a nice name, Erwin.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.500
Oh my. It appears he doesn't like me.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.120
I'm so sorry!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:20.050
Erwin! Behave!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.800
It's delicious!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.760
You're really good at cooking, Nyx!

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.480
Thank you.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.930
It's possible that experience has refined my skills.

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:41.900
Usually, Lein and I share the culinary duties.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.760
Cooking's just like experimenting.

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:48.500
Follow the recipe and anyone can do it.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.380
Experimenting?

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:54.570
What kind of research do you do, Lein?

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.550
Lots.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.330
But what kind?

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.770
Lots means lots.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.060
Thanks.

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:10.510
My, my, it's rude to leave your seat during a meal.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.930
Sorry, but I'm tired. I'm off to my room.

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:20.100
Did I say something to upset him?

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:25.730
No, he takes time to grow accustomed to new acquaintances.

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:29.140
Don't worry, Angelique.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.280
Yes sir.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:43.140
Nyx was kind enough to reassure me... but will I really be okay here?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:20.030
This time last night, I would never have dreamed that this would happen...

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.760
But from today, this will be my home.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:27.730
Please watch over me, Father... Mother...

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:38.820
Lein?

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.590
I'm sorry!

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.500
Goodnight, Lein!

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.030
Hey!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:13.930
Nyx?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:17.540
It's too early in the morning for this...

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.780
Wait!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.210
Erwin!

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:23.500
Wait!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:24.840
You...

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:27.910
Gotcha!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.840
You...

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.120
Stop it!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:38.650
That cat snuck in here and messed up my room!

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:40.560
I'm sorry!

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:47.980
Lein, I believe your room's always been a mess.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:53.340
This room has never been what you would describe as "well cleaned."

00:09:55.360 --> 00:10:02.390
I clean it in my own way; I've got a system so I know where everything is.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:06.010
I'll help you.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.520
I'll do it myself.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:13.260
These are important.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:14.970
Don't touch my books.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:40.340
We've received information that a Thanatos has materialized in Pharian.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.430
Pharian?

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:45.060
Lein is from Pharian.

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:51.230
I'll remain here and gather information on whether the damage has spread to other towns.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:55.090
I'll prepare a carriage. The two of you must head there immediately.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:02.040
Angelique, this is your first job.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:03.600
Yes.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.360
Thanatos...

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:19.820
The pretty young heroine has decided to follow her cruel destiny. Now then..

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.760
What will happen, I wonder?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.570
Where's the Thanatos?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:50.470
Hey, where's the Thanatos?

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:51.650
Where's the damage?

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:56.280
We heard that a Thanatos had appeared here in Pharia...

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.300
Oh, it was already taken care of.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:00.760
The Silver Tree Knights?

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:06.820
No, I didn't see it myself, but I heard that a young traveler dealt with the Thanatos by himself.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:09.940
Thanks to him, there was no damage.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:12.110
I'm glad.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.790
A young traveler?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.580
Who is he?

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:16.840
Where did he go?

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:19.280
I'm told that he just vanished.

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:22.710
Thank you very much.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.780
Not at all.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:27.790
This is worrying.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:32.210
If he defeated a Thanatos, then he must be a Purifier.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:36.930
Erwin?

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.740
You brought the cat?

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.490
No, he came by himself!

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:44.070
Hey!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.330
Not my problem.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:57.640
Jeez!

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:01.150
Wait, Erwin!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.140
Erwin!

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.500
Please, don't make a noise.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:30.650
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:34.680
Waiting for a girl with beautiful eyes like you to come along.

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:45.490
They're gone.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:47.930
My name is Jade.

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:51.640
I'm on a journey to make everyone happy.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:52.930
And you?

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.850
I'm Angelique...

00:13:55.910 --> 00:14:01.760
Angelique... the perfect name for a girl as angelic as you.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:03.810
Um...

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:06.370
A Thanatos!

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:07.540
Run!

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.340
Another one?

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.650
A Thanatos...

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:18.930
Hide here.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:21.540
It's all right. Don't worry.

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.670
I'll protect you.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:46.320
Thanatos, for the sake of everyone's happiness, you will now disappear.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.320
Mom!

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:11.730
Son!

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.270
<i>Noblesse Oblige</i>...

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:21.930
If you possess power, yet fail to use it; that is a sin.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.140
Erwin, wait here!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.850
Angelique!

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:00.060
Lein!

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:06.800
He's...

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.640
Who are you?

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:17.150
Nobody. Just a happy-go-lucky traveler.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.880
There's no way a happy-go-lucky traveler can fight a Thanatos!

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:23.010
Get back.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:24.930
Purify it when we're done.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.120
Yes.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:28.490
Son!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.300
Mom!

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.930
Thank you ever so much.

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:32.820
Don't mention it...

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:34.250
I'm glad he's safe.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:58.440
Damn... my attacks aren't working.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:02.940
I'll injure it. Aim at the wound.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:04.830
Got it.

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:23.470
Angelique!

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.470
Are you all right?

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:02.710
The Thanatos...

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:03.890
It was purified.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.780
By your power.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.250
Are you all right, Angelique?

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.070
Yes.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:15.840
I've never met a Purifier as cute as you.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:20.400
Are the two of you fighting Thanatos by yourselves?

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:22.320
No, there's another one of us.

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:24.150
Are you alone?

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.170
Yes. I'm traveling all across Arcadia.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:31.890
I'm sure if Nyx was here, he'd invite him to come to the Sunlit Mansion, right?

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.000
The Sunlit Mansion?

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:36.390
It's the name of our mansion in Rhys.

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:39.190
We were hired to fight the Thanatos.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.990
So you live together then.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.730
Like I said, there's someone else there!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:50.340
Um, Jade?

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.960
Won't you come with us?

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:58.540
I want to introduce you to the other Purifier. His name is Nyx.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:03.370
I'd love to accompany a beautiful girl like you...

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.390
But for now, this is farewell, Angelique.

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:09.570
Farewell!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:14.720
I'll visit the Sunlit Mansion someday!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.850
What's with that guy?

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:27.710
Um, Lein?

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:30.920
Was it okay to leave Pharian so suddenly?

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:32.140
It's fine.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.120
There's no one I want to see there.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.580
I see...

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:42.150
Artifacts.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:47.740
Normally, the word refers to the lost technological legacy of ancient civilizations,

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:53.380
but sometimes, it can be used to indicate newly-created devices using similar principles.

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:56.670
That's the theme of my research.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.510
You wanted to know, didn't you?

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:05.080
Artifacts are treasure chests that contain humanity's hopes and dreams.

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:20.960
And you don't have to be so formal around me all the time.

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:22.480
Don't be so nervous.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.890
And stop trying to be so polite when you talk.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:28.100
All right, Lein...

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:33.910
We're back at the Sunlit Mansion.

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:39.720
Welcome back.

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:43.770
Jade?

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:45.200
Why are you here?

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:48.310
Angelique invited me here, right?

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:49.740
I did, but...

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:51.610
But that outfit...

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:53.130
Oh, this?

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:56.010
Looks like they wanted me to wear one.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:21:00.990
There are too many jokes I could make, I don't even know where to start.

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:02.720
Welcome back.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:07.850
Our distinguished traveler has prepared our evening meal.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:10.460
Caesar salad and pumpkin pie.

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:13.300
Let's all chow down together!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.810
Coordinates 2-4-6.

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:25.250
Point 6.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:28.230
The ship's been made fast.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:32.110
Director Yorgo, the preparations to commence salvaging are complete.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.400
All right, bring it up.

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:35.940
Yes sir.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.400
Initiating salvaging.

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:58.830
The Stellar Vessel...

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:38.160
Hey, Lein...

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:41.750
Do guys get embarrassed when they're seen naked too?

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:44.080
Never mind!

00:23:44.510 --> 00:23:46.620
Next time: The Silver Knights!

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:48.910
Did someone see me naked?
